    "message": "Expect no fallback in a generated Run now that its kernels refuse nothing\n\nThe census test asked the first tick of a generated Run to fall back in the\ndriver. Lanes L2 to L4 closed every refusal that Run reached, so the test now\nchecks that the census counts the Run's ticks and that nothing falls back.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01K4QyYRukuCLBerKa4UYj4y",
